Package: OlinkAssay
Title: Olink HT quality control, processing, and organization
Version: 0.1.0.0000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given="Ben", family="Jones", email = "ben.jones@omrf.org", role = c("aut")),
    person(given="Miles", family="Smith", email = "miles.smith@omrf.org", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0651-809X")),
    person(given="Rufei", family="Lu", email = "rufei.lu@omrf.org", role = c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-3644-4702")))
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Description: Provides a S4 class (based on SummarizedExperiment) and functions for importing, processing,
 and correcting of Olink HT data. Runs quality control, performs batch correction, filters bad samples and
 assays, and matches samples to projects listed in an associated manifest. 
